*require 1.4.22
*begin
*case preserve
*truncate off
*set separator :
*set names ._-
*units default
*calibrate default
*sd default
*flags not duplicate not splay not surface
*infer equates off
*infer plumbs off
*infer exports off
*data normal from to tape compass clino
*declination 0 degrees
*date 2020-01-01
1.0 1.1 10.020 90 0
*date 2022-01-01
1.0 1.1 10.000 90 0
*date 2024-01-01
1.0 1.1 9.980 90 0
*end
